==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From the verb [[log in]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/'lɑgɪn/}}
* {{audio|en-us-login.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{computing}} A [[combination]] of a [[user]]'s [[identification]] and [[password]] used to enter a [[computer]], [[program]], [[network]], etc.
# {{computing}} The process of logging in.

